    <p>
      BA in Slavic Language &amp; Literature from National Chengchi University. Self-taught iOS developer
      and Shopify builder. Founded and ran Patour Consulting Kft. in Budapest (2022–2023), navigating
      EU regulatory, legal, and administrative compliance independently.
    </p>

